---
// Pull-quote: E = mc² with kicker + caption.
---

<aside data-fade class="my-16 relative">
  <div class="rule mb-10"></div>
  <div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center gap-6">
    <div class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.28em] uppercase text-plasma/70">
      mass-energy equivalence
    </div>
    <div
      class="katex-faux text-white"
      style="font-size: clamp(3.2rem, 9vw, 7rem); line-height: 1;"
    >
      E<span class="op">=</span>m<span>c</span><sup>2</sup>
    </div>
    <div
      class="max-w-[42ch] text-white/55 text-[14px] font-sans tracking-[0.02em]"
    >
      A very small amount of mass equals a huge amount of energy. Matter and
      energy are the same thing in different forms.
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="rule mt-10"></div>
</aside>
